00:50:59.037 --> 00:51:05.119
success is driven by people, if you
are better at relating with our people,

00:51:05.119 --> 00:51:10.750
that's a huge advantage,
because everything you do is with people.

00:51:10.750 --> 00:51:14.198
Your family is made of people,
you relate personal relations is people,

00:51:14.198 --> 00:51:16.653
